1.	Who has charge of the Government Experimental Farm at Farnham, Quebec?
2.	What are the names of the persons employed by him upon the said farm since the first of January, 1914?
3.	What salary has each of the said employees received?
4.	What balance, if any, is due to the said employees for work and labour performed prior to January 1, 1916?
5.	Why has said balance not yet been paid? Mr. HAZEN:
1.	Mr. Omer Victor Chevalier.
2	and 3. Amounts paid from January 1 1914, to March 31, 1916: H. Gariapy, $17.25-
